# SchemeSaathi Backend Configuration
# ----------------------------------------
# 1. Open-Weight Model Selection:
# Candidates: Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (Recommended) or meta-llama/Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct
AI_MODEL_NAME=Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct

# 2. Hugging Face Serverless Inference (Optional - Free HuggingFace token works!)
# Get a free user access token from: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=your_huggingface_user_token_here

# 3. Local OpenAI-Compatible Server (Optional - e.g. Ollama or LM Studio)
# Example for local Ollama: http://localhost:11434/v1
OPENAI_BASE_URL=

# Note: If neither HF_TOKEN nor OPENAI_BASE_URL is provided, SchemeSaathi automatically
# operates in transparent, verifiable deterministic mode with explicit UI attribution.
